findings.comment:
750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) inside cabinet below handsink at dish area (splash/debris);
B) walkin cooler shelves (mold/buildup);
C) wire shelving throughout (general buildup - time for detail cleaning);
D) fryer - wheels and inside lower compartment around mechanicals (grease/food debris);
E) reach-in cooler at mini make line by the drive thru (food debris/condensate);  
F) inside motor and soda line compartment and inner surfaces of the doors to the compartment at dining room soda machine (moisture/mold/debris);  and
G) under quesadilla steamers and presses (food debris/dust).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) bottom inside quesadilla steamers (food debris);
B) under quesadilla steamers and presses (food debris);
C) inside motor and soda line compartment beneath lobby drink machine (splash);
D) mini line by drive thru (food debris in top right compartment);
E) walkin cooler shelves (splash/mold);
F) wire shelving throughout (grimy buildup on lower shelves); 
G) storage areas beneath make lines (food debris);  and
H) inside cabinet beneath lobby condiment caddy (dust/debris). 

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

findings.citation_text:
750.1220 - A) Floor drains throughout were soiled. Heavy mold accumulation was observed on covers and in drains under the mini line by the drive thru and under both soda machines. Thoroughly clean floor drains and covers throughout daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of mold and debris. Accumulation of mold, debris, and moisture serves as a food/water source for pests.

B) Floors were soiled with buildup of food and/or general debris in the following areas:
1. under shelving in walkin cooler;
2. walkin freezer (ice accumulation and debris);
3. along walls under equipment at drive thru (behind mini line, behind soda machine, etc.); 
4. along walls/in corners beneath lobby soda machine;  and
5. around drain under 3 part sink.
Clean the floor in the aforementioned areas and throughout daily/as needed

Floors and drains shall be maintained clean.
